Subject: [PATCH] fix(pr86): reject incomplete receipt graph and enforce
 source_id allowlist

- preparePlan: when receipt exists, verify all node_ids/links/parents against
  receipt (corruption) while allowing legitimate title edits on intact graph
- preparePlan: reject pre-existing plan link_id collisions
- validatePlan: default source_id allowlist; overridable via opts.allowedSourceIds
- add L1 negative tests (independent of PR #85)

Local-only commit; no push/PR.
